<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Griffith Joyner returns five weeks after a left frontal craniotomy with complete removal of the cavernous malformation and its hemosiderin rim. She went home on the third day. The MRI the day after surgery showed complete resection. She needed acetaminophen for about two weeks and nothing since. The incision has healed. She has had no seizure, spell, headache, or change in smell, mood or concentration. She has walked daily since the second week and began easy running last week without symptoms. She takes levetiracetam twice a day; the irritability has gone. She has not driven. She has had no thoughts of self-harm. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Surgery</td><td>Complete lesionectomy; home on day 3; MRI: complete resection</td></tr><tr><td>Seizures</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Training</td><td>Walking, then easy running for a week</td></tr><tr><td>Levetiracetam</td><td>Taken twice daily; irritability resolved</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

